            "text": "This manual describes the routine upkeep of the small-boat harbour. It was\nwritten to be read on paper, so its paragraphs are hard-wrapped at about\neighty columns and its sections are marked the way a typewriter would."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
