            "footnote_ref": null,
            "href": null,
            "math": null,
            "styles": [],
            "text": "1. Check the mooring lines for chafe.\n2. Test the shore power posts.\n2.1 Reset any tripped breaker once.\n2.2 Report a second trip to the harbour master.\n3. Clear litter from the slipway."
          }
